DESCRIPTION >
    Raw schema mirror of able-folio-499722.stripe.customer.
    Source role: customer_identity_state.
    Nullable source keys use non-null internal DEFAULT projections for MergeTree sorting.

SCHEMA >
    `id` Nullable(String) `json:$.id`,
    `account_balance` Nullable(Int64) `json:$.account_balance`,
    `balance` Nullable(Int64) `json:$.balance`,
